        "command": "// === 食人魔猛击 FX · 攻击行动触发（分时序：漩涡→1s锤子→2.3s裂地）===\ntry {\n  const _wf = (typeof workflow !== \"undefined\" && workflow) ? workflow : null;\n  if (_wf && _wf.activity && _wf.activity.type === \"attack\") {\n    // 防双播：ItemMacro自动钩子 + midi onUse 会各触发一次，同一次攻击只放行一次\n    const _k = _wf.id || _wf.uuid || _wf.itemUuid;\n    if (_k) {\n      globalThis.__ogreSlamFired = globalThis.__ogreSlamFired || new Set();\n      if (globalThis.__ogreSlamFired.has(_k)) return;\n      globalThis.__ogreSlamFired.add(_k);\n      setTimeout(() => { try { globalThis.__ogreSlamFired.delete(_k); } catch (e) {} }, 6000);\n    }\n    const _src = (_wf.token && (_wf.token.object || _wf.token))\n              || canvas.tokens.get(_wf.tokenId)\n              || (typeof token !== \"undefined\" && token && (token.object || token))\n              || null;\n    const _pool = (_wf.hitTargets && _wf.hitTargets.size) ? _wf.hitTargets\n                 : (_wf.targets && _wf.targets.size ? _wf.targets : []);\n    const _tgts = [..._pool].map(t => t.object || t).filter(Boolean);\n    if (_src && typeof Sequence !== \"undefined\") {\n      const _seq = new Sequence();\n      // t=0：火焰漩涡（落我身上）+ 增益音\n      _seq.effect().file(\"blfx.spell.cast.swirl1.fire1.orange\").atLocation(_src).scale(0.7);\n      _seq.sound().file(\"blfx.sound.spell.cast.buff.1\").volume(1.0);\n      for (const _t of (_tgts.length ? _tgts : [null])) {\n        // t=1.0s：巨棒挥砸音（满音量 + 错开40ms叠一层）\n        _seq.sound().file(\"blfx.sound.weapon.melee.greatclub.attack2\").volume(1.0).delay(1000);\n        _seq.sound().file(\"blfx.sound.weapon.melee.greatclub.attack2\").volume(1.0).delay(1040);\n        // t=1.0s：砸击——居中落目标、放大6倍、mirrorX掰正基础朝向（此资源美术偏心，不旋转）\n        _seq.effect()\n          .file(\"blfx.weapon.melee.greatclub1.attack1.slam.trail1.blue\")\n          .atLocation(_t || _src)\n          .scaleToObject(6)\n          .mirrorX()\n          .delay(1000);\n        // t=1.0s：命中音\n        if (_t) {\n          _seq.sound().file(\"blfx.sound.spell.cast.entangle.roots.1\").volume(1.0).delay(1000);\n          _seq.sound().file(\"blfx.sound.spell.cast.entangle.roots.1\").volume(0.9).delay(1040);\n        }\n        // t=2.3s：裂地（锤子后1.3秒），jb2a一次性、目标2倍大\n        if (_t) _seq.effect()\n          .file(\"jb2a.impact.ground_crack.orange.01\")\n          .atLocation(_t)\n          .scaleToObject(2)\n          .delay(2300);\n      }\n      _seq.play();\n    }\n    return; // 攻击分支到此为止，不进入装填器\n  }\n} catch (_e) { console.error(\"OgreSlamFX |\", _e); }\n\n\n// 魔晶石装填器 · 剑内置物品宏\ntry {\n  // 仅「装填」行动触发；挥砍等其它行动忽略\n  const wf = (typeof workflow !== \"undefined\" && workflow) ? workflow : null;\n  if (wf && wf.activity && !(wf.activity.name || \"\").includes(\"装填\")) return;\n\n  const blade = item;\n  const WID = blade.id;\n  const SLOTS = Math.max(3, actor.system.abilities?.str?.mod ?? 0, actor.system.abilities?.dex?.mod ?? 0);  // 槽数=主属性(力/敏取高)调整值, 至少3\n  const maxTok = Number(blade.system.uses?.max) || 1;\n  const editAvail = (blade.system.uses?.spent ?? 0) < maxTok;\n\n  const slotted = {};\n  for (const it of actor.items) {\n    const m = it.getFlag(\"world\", \"materiaSlot\");\n    if (m && m.weapon === WID) slotted[m.slot] = it;\n  }\n  const templates = game.items.filter(i => i.getFlag(\"world\", \"materiaStoneId\"));\n  const tplOpts = templates.map(t => `<option value=\"${t.id}\">${t.name}（${t.system.price?.value ?? 0} GP）</option>`).join(\"\");\n  const gp = actor.system.currency?.gp ?? 0;\n\n  let content = `<p style=\"margin:.3em 0\">为 <b>${blade.name}</b> 管理魔晶石（${SLOTS} 槽，可重复装同一种）。当前金币：<b>${gp} GP</b>。</p>`;\n  content += editAvail\n    ? `<p style=\"font-size:.85em;opacity:.8\">本次长休可装填：每装 1 颗按该魔晶石的标价扣费；替换或清空会销毁原石（不退回）。</p>`\n    : `<p style=\"color:#a55;font-size:.85em\">本次长休的装填额度已用完——下次长休后可再改。当前为只读查看。</p>`;\n  for (let n = 1; n <= SLOTS; n++) {\n    const cur = slotted[n] ? `<b>${slotted[n].name}</b>` : `<i>空</i>`;\n    content += `<div style=\"margin:.35em 0;padding:.35em;border:1px solid #0003;border-radius:6px\"><div>晶槽 ${n} — 当前：${cur}</div>`;\n    if (editAvail) {\n      content += `<select name=\"slot${n}\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:.25em\"><option value=\"\">— 保持当前 —</option>`\n        + (slotted[n] ? `<option value=\"__clear__\">— 清空本槽（销毁原石）—</option>` : ``)\n        + tplOpts + `</select>`;\n    }\n    content += `</div>`;\n  }\n  if (editAvail && !templates.length)\n    content += `<p style=\"color:#a55\">没找到魔晶石模板，请先把 8 颗石头导入「物品」目录。</p>`;\n\n  async function applyLoad(event, button, dialog) {\n    const root = dialog.element;\n    let changed = false;\n    let gpLeft = actor.system.currency?.gp ?? 0;\n    const dc = actor.system.attributes?.spelldc ?? 13;\n    for (let n = 1; n <= SLOTS; n++) {\n      const pick = root.querySelector(`[name=\"slot${n}\"]`)?.value;\n      if (!pick) continue;\n      if (slotted[n]) { try { await slotted[n].delete(); } catch (_) {} }\n      if (pick === \"__clear__\") { changed = true; continue; }\n      const tpl = templates.find(t => t.id === pick);\n      if (!tpl) continue;\n      const cost = tpl.system.price?.value ?? 0;\n      if (gpLeft < cost) { ui.notifications.warn(`金币不足（需 ${cost} GP），晶槽 ${n} 未装填。`); continue; }\n      gpLeft -= cost;\n      const data = tpl.toObject();\n      delete data._id;\n      data.name = `〔晶槽${n}〕` + tpl.name;\n      foundry.utils.setProperty(data, \"flags.world.materiaSlot\", { weapon: WID, slot: n });\n      for (const ef of (data.effects || [])) {\n        for (const ch of (ef.changes || [])) {\n          if (ch.key === \"flags.midi-qol.OverTime\")\n            ch.value = String(ch.value).replace(/saveDC=\\d+/, `saveDC=${dc}`);\n        }\n      }\n      await actor.createEmbeddedDocuments(\"Item\", [data]);\n      changed = true;\n    }\n    if (changed) {\n      await actor.update({ \"system.currency.gp\": gpLeft });\n      await blade.update({ \"system.uses.spent\": maxTok });\n      ui.notifications.info(`${blade.name}：装填完成，剩余 ${gpLeft} GP。`);\n    }\n  }\n\n  const buttons = editAvail\n    ? [{ action: \"save\", icon: \"fa-solid fa-gem\", label: \"确认装填\", default: true, callback: applyLoad },\n       { action: \"cancel\", icon: \"fa-solid fa-xmark\", label: \"取消\" }]\n    : [{ action: \"ok\", icon: \"fa-solid fa-eye\", label: \"关闭\", default: true }];\n\n  new foundry.applications.api.DialogV2({ window: { title: `魔晶石装填器 · ${blade.name}` }, content, buttons }).render(true);\n} catch (err) { console.error(\"MateriaLoader |\", err); }"
      }
